# Route: guide 46 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 19 quests, 0.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Azshara): Shadowsong Shrine -> Valormok -> The Shattered Strand ->
# Southridge Beach -> Temple of Arkkoran -> Thalassian Base Camp -> Temple of
# Arkkoran -> Southridge Beach -> Valormok -> The Ruined Reaches.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Name of the Beast (3510;
# Hetaera 55).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

